&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;福岡市博多区に福岡支店を開設。&lt;/p&gt;
