&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;㈱ユニオンシンク監査役（現任）&lt;/p&gt;
